flowchart LR
  U[Customers and staff] --> CDN[CDN / application tier]
  CDN --> W[Transactional writes]
  CDN --> R[Read-only catalogue and reporting]

  subgraph UK1[Primary UK region]
    PG[(PostgreSQL primary)]
    ST[(Synchronous AZ standby)]
    RR[(Read replica)]
    M1[(MongoDB member 1)]
    M2[(MongoDB member 2)]
    PG -->|synchronous WAL| ST
    PG -->|asynchronous WAL| RR
    M1 <-->|replication| M2
  end

  subgraph UK2[Disaster-recovery region]
    DR[(PostgreSQL DR replica)]
    M3[(MongoDB voting member 3)]
    BK[(Encrypted object backup)]
  end

  W --> PG
  R --> RR
  R --> M1
  PG -->|asynchronous WAL| DR
  M1 <-->|replication| M3
  PG -->|daily backup + WAL archive| BK
